From 4a002129f8b97f32980afd59e5a1a64c428fe684 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LUOXIAO92 <89069722+LUOXIAO92@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:27:42 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] graftling 0.6.2 (528)

The changes since 0.6.1 are 526 (graftling writes a `.gitignore` holding `*`
into its own sessions/, control/, live/ and native/ directories, so DSH's
changes card no longer lists the session archive as a file edit) and 527
(DSH's browser shows agents calls in its native Tool card). Neither changes a
public name, result or archive format, so the release is compatible by
section 7 and raises the patch version; GraphTraj's range
graftling>=0.6.0,<0.7 includes it. Package, plugin and npm manifests and the
CHANGELOG name 0.6.2; the CHANGELOG gains 526's entry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/graftling/CHANGELOG.md                          | 13 +++++++++++--
 src/graftling/__init__.py                           |  2 +-
 .../claude-plugin/.claude-plugin/plugin.json        |  2 +-
 src/graftling/dsh/package.json                      |  2 +-
 src/graftling/pi/package.json                       |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/graftling/CHANGELOG.md b/src/graftling/CHANGELOG.md
index 3761cfd..85321cd 100644
--- a/src/graftling/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/src/graftling/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -12,8 +12,17 @@ version that identifies everything listed under it.
 
 The numbers in parentheses are the project's Task numbers.
 
-## Unreleased
-
+## 0.6.2 (compatible)
+
+- graftling keeps its runtime directories out of the caller's git work tree (526). When
+  a data root sits inside a git repository, DSH's per-turn changes card (which snapshots
+  the work tree with `git add --all`) listed the rewritten session archive as a file
+  edit. graftling now writes a `.gitignore` holding `*` into the graftling-named
+  subdirectories it writes (`sessions/`, `control/`, `live/`, `native/`) when they exist:
+  never at the caller's root, never over an existing file, and a failed write is
+  ignored. Archive content and format, public names and results are unchanged, so the
+  change is compatible (section 7 of the public interface). GraphTraj's range
+  `graftling>=0.6.0,<0.7` includes it.
 - DSH's browser shows agents calls in its own native Tool card (527). The `graftling-dsh`
   client module no longer registers a `tool.call.toolview` view for
   `mcp__graftling__agents` or the older `mcp__agents__agents`, so both now show as the
diff --git a/src/graftling/__init__.py b/src/graftling/__init__.py
index 18dab7b..73a0133 100644
--- a/src/graftling/__init__.py
+++ b/src/graftling/__init__.py
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ this file; anything it does not list is internal.
 
 # The only definition of the distribution version; packaging and every
 # runtime report (MCP serverInfo, Codex clientInfo) read it from here.
-__version__ = "0.6.1"
+__version__ = "0.6.2"
 
 from importlib import import_module
 
